  <section id="next-day-retrieval" data-lesson-extension="Next-day verb family, remembered responsibility, and used-to contrast retrieval">
    <h2>Next-day retrieval</h2>
    <div class="lead-rule"></div>
    <p>Return without rereading the page. Identify the controlling verb or expression, decide whether <span class="ex">to</span> is an infinitive marker or a preposition, and use the supplied context to interpret any meaning-changing pair.</p>
    <div class="quiz" data-quiz data-success-message="Correct. You retained suggest + -ing, remember + to-infinitive for a completed responsibility, and the contrast between used to + base and be used to + -ing.">
